OL,3,GNEWSACrofters and farmers call for new
OL,4,Aplan to tackle wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrofters and farmers in the Cairngorms
OL,7,Fare calling for a new, comprehensive
OL,8,Fplan to deal with moorland fires to be
OL,9,Fput in place within six months.
OL,11,FThe demand follows a second major
OL,12,Fsummer wildfire in as many years in the
OL,13,FUK's largest national park.
OL,15,FThe plea was made to Agriculture
OL,16,FMinister Jim Fairlie and a senior
OL,17,Fofficer from the Scottish Fire and
OL,18,FRescue Service (SFRS) during a public
OL,19,Fmeeting in Aveimore on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
